WEBVTT

00:08:30.172 --> 00:08:33.300
There is, you know,
a food crisis, a fuel crisis,

00:08:33.342 --> 00:08:34.843
there was the COVID crisis

00:08:34.843 --> 00:08:38.013
and a lack of equitable
access to vaccines.

00:08:38.055 --> 00:08:40.391
And behind that, and there all the time,

00:08:40.391 --> 00:08:43.310
and much earlier,
has been the climate crisis.

00:08:43.352 --> 00:08:49.275
So how do you want the conference
that we're going to see,

00:08:49.316 --> 00:08:54.238
the African Conference
in Egypt in November, COP27,

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:55.739
how do you see the priorities?

00:08:55.739 --> 00:08:57.241
What do you want to see happen?

00:08:57.283 --> 00:08:59.159
VN: When it comes to loss and damage,

00:08:59.201 --> 00:09:03.956
the climate crisis is pushing so many
communities beyond adaptation.